	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d12_visitor03_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あの　ポケモンは　どんな　きもちで
あの　へやに　いたのかの……▽
ずっと　いっぴきだと　さみしいだろうに</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-23T10:32:39" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:13" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あの　ポケモンは　どんな　気持ちで
あの部屋に　いたのかの……▽
ずっと　一匹だと　寂しいだろうに</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-23T10:33:00" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:13" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・GRIDX=297、GRIDZ=750、右向き（向き固定）
※swanでメッセージ調整</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-23T10:47:30" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>OLDWOMAN1</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
